<title>BELGIUM: BELGIAN LORRY TURNED INTO CHOCOLATE FONDUE.</title>
<headline>BELGIAN LORRY TURNED INTO CHOCOLATE FONDUE.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Belgian lorry driver trapped by some of the coldest weather to hit Belgium in years tried unfreezing his fuel tank with a blow torch and finished up with a giant chocolate fondue.</p>
<p>Police said on Friday the diesel fuel caught fire, melting the tonnes of Belgian chocolates the lorry was carrying.</p>
